tto/gt-telegram"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "johnfn"}, "story_text": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["gas", "town"], "value": "Just curious so I don't get booted off the platform.<p>My understanding is that <em>Gas</em> <em>Town</em> + others wrap Claude MAX subscriptions. But the ToS says you may not &quot;Except when you are accessing our Services via an Anthropic API Key or where we otherwise explicitly permit it, to access the Services through automated or non-human means, whether through a bot, script, or otherwise.&quot;<p>My read is that bans orchestrator tools. But I'm pretty sure Yegge et al haven't been banned from the platform. So what am I missing?"}, "title": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["gas", "town"], "value": "Is <em>Gas</em> <em>Town</em> (and other similar tools) legit by the Anthropic ToS?"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_johnfn", "story_46806074", "ask_hn"], "author": "johnfn", "children": [46881029], "created_at": "2026-01-29T05:15:05Z", "created_at_i": 1769663705, "num_comments": 1, "objectID": "46806074", "points": 1, "story_id": 46806074, "story_text": "Just curious so I don&#x27;t get booted off the platform.<p>My understanding is that Gas Town + others wrap Claude MAX subscriptions. But the ToS says you may not &quot;Except when you are accessing our Services via an Anthropic API Key or where we otherwise explicitly permit it, to access the Services through automated or non-human means, whether through a bot, script, or otherwise.&quot;<p>My read is that bans orchestrator tools. But I&#x27;m pretty sure Yegge et al haven&#x27;t been banned from the platform. So what am I missing?", "title": "Is Gas Town (and other similar tools) legit by the Anthropic ToS?", "updated_at": "2026-03-05T23:25:42Z"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "geoffbp"}, "title": {"fullyHighli